    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/bf7474610b8c6e226381de709d3f32f8.poster.avif?t=1751909272\" width=616 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/bf7474610b8c6e226381de709d3f32f8.webm?t=1751909272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>Dear Guest,\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We are delighted you are staying with us at The Six Keys.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Our aim is to make sure you won't want to leave.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We humbly await your arrival..</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/909f19d694f233642d63a7595c284a99.poster.avif?t=1751909272\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/909f19d694f233642d63a7595c284a99.webm?t=1751909272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >   </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Void Between</strong> is an FMV style puzzle game, merging live action video with puzzling point and click gameplay in a supernatural, otherworldly setting.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd Uncover clues in a real world setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd Overcome mysterious challenges set by a sinister stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd Decipher the difference between what's real and illusion through your choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd How this story ends is up to you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/3aa1bc3edffde058c49075836ee21383.poster.avif?t=1751909272\" width=800 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/3aa1bc3edffde058c49075836ee21383.webm?t=1751909272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/3aa1bc3edffde058c49075836ee21383.mp4?t=1751909272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A note from management,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>You</u></i></strong> <i>have our guarantee that your stay with us</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>will</u></i></strong><i> be a one of kind experience. You will sleep like</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>never</u></i></strong><i> before!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Leave</u></i></strong> <i>your troubles at the door!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>This</u></i></strong> is your home now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<strong><i><u>Place</u></i></strong> your shoes at the door.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep well,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T h e \u00a0S i\u00a0x \u00a0K e y s\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/9af6b1066b5ace517deea2cfcbe2aaae.poster.avif?t=1751909272\" width=538 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/9af6b1066b5ace517deea2cfcbe2aaae.webm?t=1751909272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678440/extras/9af6b1066b5ace517deea2cfcbe2aaae.mp4?t=1751909272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
